<title>UK: Hepworth buys stake in Protherm Group.</title>
<headline>Hepworth buys stake in Protherm Group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British heating and building materials group Hepworth Plc said on Monday it bought a stake in the Protherm Group, including 34 percent each of Protherm and Transkom in the Czech Republic and Protherm in Slovakia.</p>
<p>The company also said it entered arrangements to increase its holding in each company to 90 percent, subject to a maximum payment of 26.5 million stg in cash.  </p>
<p>The Protherm Group, which sells gas boilers in the Czech Republic and Slovakia, had total pretax profits of 1.3 million stg last year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
